OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Fears over the AI boom
OL,4,Ahaven't gone away
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestors are jittery. Already
OL,7,FAnthropic is now trading notably lower
OL,8,Fthan last week's stock market
OL,9,Fflotation. The firm is the first purely
OL,10,FAI company to be publicly listed, and
OL,11,Fis being seen as a big test for
OL,12,Fcontinued investor appetite for the
OL,13,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
