OL,3,AIrish reality star dances her way to
OL,4,Afinal of Dancing with the Stars
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaura Higgins is arguably Love Island's
OL,7,Fbiggest success story.
OL,9,FSince leaving the villa in Majorca,
OL,10,FHiggins maintained a high profile in
OL,11,Fthe UK, Ireland and across the Atlantic
OL,12,Fwhere she has presented Love Island:
OL,13,FAftersun in the US, and was runner up
OL,14,Fin The Traitors US.
OL,16,FWhile she failed to find love with
OL,17,FCurtis Pritchard in the 2019 series,
OL,18,Fshe may have picked up a few of the
OL,19,Fballroom dancer's moves.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
